        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX FH23PD8010, Square Urban Pocket Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Urban Flush Pull Passage Set is perfect for sliding pocket doors in modern homes. As a passage set, it comes packaged with 2 square flush pulls and a mortise box with a retractable finger pull. This makes getting the door from its pocket easy. The Square Urban Pocket Door Passage Set is available in a wide selection of finishes. Depending on which finish color you choose, the Urban Flush Pulls will be either made out of brass or stainless steel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/urban-flush-pull-privacy-set-inox-fh23pd8440\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/urban-flush-pull-keyed-entry-set-inox-fh23pd8450\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Urban Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass or Stainless</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Length: 2-3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 5/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 5-29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Depth: 3-41/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Backset: 2-3/4\", 2-1/2\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-FH23PD8010-specifications.pdf?v=1704262379\"><b>INOX FH23PD8010 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a passage set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
